## 📞 Support & Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

**Q: Why am I not seeing bot activity?**
- A: Check if tracker.js is properly installed with valid project ID
- Verify bot patterns match expected User-Agents
- Check aggregation jobs are running

**Q: Why is API slow?**
- A: Check page_visits table size and indexes
- Review rate limiting settings
- Monitor geolocation service performance

**Q: Why is geolocation data missing?**
- A: Verify geolocation service integration (IP2Location, MaxMind, etc.)
- Check for VPN/proxy IPs (may fail lookup)
- Review service quota limits

